spice
* SPICE Netlist
Vsig 1 0 DC 0 AC 1    * Voltage source Vsig
Rsig 1 2 10k          * Resistor Rsig
Cgs 2 0 10p           * Capacitor Cgs
Gm 0 6 4 5 1e-3       * Current source Gm*Vgs
Rgm 5 6 1k            * Resistor 1/gm
Ro 6 3 100k           * Resistor ro
RL 3 7 10k            * Resistor RL
CL 7 0 10p            * Capacitor CL + Cgd

* Nodes:
* 1: Vsig
* 2: Source
* 3: D
* 4: Drain of Gm
* 5: Gate of Gm
* 6: Positive terminal of Ro
* 7: Output Vo

.END